      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Neurotization provoked a stable activation of lipid peroxidation in homogenates and synaptosomes of the rat brain cortex. The activation persisted for 8 days after cessation of the neurotization. A single short-term emotional-pain stress produced but a transient increase of the lipid peroxidation level."},
